        "candidate_id": "C_0175c56ca1cf5c0c_1",
        "edit": "No change: the RTL already matches the oracle behavior for the observed mismatch (ena asserted yields y=0). The reported divergence at cycle0 (actual 00000001 vs expected 00000000) is not reproducible from this source under the stated enable condition, so no local dataflow repair is justified by the provided evidence.",
